            "review_title": "Review at Laairai Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "hoang thong\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nThe deliciousness of this ramen is truly insane\nNov 2024 • Couples\nLocated in a small street of bustling Thao Dien, discovering LAAIRAI was a huge surprise for my wife and I. We entered the restaurant and felt the spirit of blending foreign things with one of the quintessence of Vietnamese cuisine. The most special thing is that the restaurant's dishes are extremely unique. I don't want to spoil the review but want everyone to have their own feelings when reading the restaurant's menu for the first time. Below I have included a photo of the dish that both my wife and I were amazed by when we ate it. The deliciousness of this ramen is truly unique.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 13, 2024\nLaairai Eatery\nThank you for sharing your fantastic experience at Laairai Thao Dien! Happy to hear that you enjoyed our unique atmosphere and our Signature Mackerel Ramen! \n\nWe look forward to welcoming you and your wife back for more delicious meals!\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
