            "review_title": "Review at Laairai Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Julie Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nDiscover the culinary gem of Thao Dien District 2 in HCM city - Laairai Eatery !\nNov 2024 • Friends\nThis hidden gem offers an unforgettable dining experience with its unique fusion menu. The grilled mackerel ramen was a must-try - perfectly balanced with rich, smoky flavors that lingered on your tongue.\n\nBut the real star of the show was their signature spaghetti with mushroom sauce and mentaiko - an incredible fusion of Japanese and Italian cuisines. The grilled items were fresh and expertly prepared.\n\nThe ambiance is versatile - perfect for business lunches or cozy dinner gatherings. The space works well for both occasions, and the draft beer selection complements their grilled dishes perfectly. It’s the ideal spot for casual meetups with friends or business dining.\n\nWhat makes Laairai stand out is their ability to create unique flavor combinations across different cuisines. They’ve mastered the art of fusion, and you won’t find these dishes anywhere else in HCMC.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for innovative fusion cuisine in a comfortable setting.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nMust try are Mentaiko mushrooms spaghetti and grilled fish ramen. Roasted pork with ST rice and veggies also good too.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 30, 2024\nLaairai Eatery\nThank you for sharing your love for our Signature Mackerel Ramen and Mentaiko Spaghetti also. \n\nWe look forward to welcoming you and your team again very soon.\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
