            "review_text": "lê n\n1 contribution\n0\nLARAAI FOOD\nNov 2024 • Friends\nHave been coming and enjoying Lairaai's food since the early days, had a wonderful experience and will always remember the food here, especially the spaghetti with cod roe and mushroom sauce, it taste fatty and moderately salty and sweet enough. There is also grilled american beef with ponzu sauce, the beef is tender and goes well with the sauce\nA good thing about Lairaai is that it always updates its food and menu images so that every time you go out to eat, it's different experience, but the dishes that make up the brand are always retained.\nAbout friendly service, timely and natural support\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 28, 2024\nLaairai Eatery\nThank you so so much for your long time love and loyalty all these years. It's our pleasure to bring you and your friends long lasting memories!\n\nWe hope you come back for more new dishes and experiences. Much love!\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
