            "review_text": "tri d\n6 contributions\n0\nOne of the best Vietnamese Izakaya in town\nNov 2024 • Friends\nLaairai is a modern restaurant tucked away in a small street with a cozy local vibe. I visited with friends, and it’s an ideal spot for groups of 4-6 people or a romantic date. \n\nThe menu offers a great mix of fusion dishes, and my favorites were the mackerel ramen, cooked in a Vietnamese style with starfruit, pineapple, and dill, and the young goby fish salad. \n\nBoth were fresh, flavorful, and beautifully prepared. The staff were attentive, and the atmosphere was warm and inviting. I’ll definitely be back to enjoy more of their delicious food!\nRead more\nWritten November 27, 2024\nLaairai Eatery\nThank you for visiting us. We are very happy to hear that you and your friends had a good, enjoyable meals.\n\nSee you again soon for our upcoming new dishes!\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
